	info = "SITE-104 LCZ SECURITY FORM 22-C<b><i>OBJECT CHECKOUT AUTHORIZATION</i></b><br><b>Issuing Department:</b> Light Containment Security - Archival Object Vaults<br><b>Revision:</b> 22-C-LCZ-ARCH<br><b>Clearance Requirement:</b> <i>Level 2 or higher</i><br><b>Handling Category:</b> Temporary Removal of Classified Object(s) from Vault Storage<br><br><b>SECTION A - REQUESTING PERSONNEL INFORMATION</b><br>A-1. Full Name: ____________________________________________<br>A-2. Assigned Division/Department: __________________________<br>A-3. Current Clearance Level: ________ (Verify)<br>A-4. Supervisor (if applicable): ________________________<br><br><b>SECTION B - OBJECT IDENTIFICATION</b><br>B-1. Object Numerical Designation: ____________________________________<br>B-2. Object Classification Category:<br> (Select all that Apply)[ ] <i>Non-Hazardous</i>- [ ] <i>Thaumiel</i>- [ ] <i>Restricted</i>- [ ] <i>Hazard-Adjacent</i>- [ ]  <i>Sensitive</i><br>B-3. Storage Vault Location: ________________________________<br>B-4. Physical Condition on Removal:<br>______________________________________________________________<br>(Attach additional sheets if necessary.)<br><br><b>SECTION C - PURPOSE OF CHECKOUT</b><br>C-1. Authorized Research Activity / Test Designation:<br>________________________________________________________________<br>C-2. Summary of Intended Use (<i>mandatory</i>):<br>________________________________________________________________<br>________________________________________________________________<br><br>[<i>To be reviewed by the vault officer</i>]<br><b>SECTION D - USAGE LIMITATIONS</b><br>By signing below, the requester acknowledges the following mandatory restrictions:<br>- Object MUST remain within designated LCZ testing environments unless otherwise specified.<br>- Object MUST be kept under continuous observational logging per Containment Directives.<br>- No modifications, disassembly, replication, or informal experimentation permitted.<br>- Required Return Time:<br>-[ ] <i>2 hours</i>- [ ] <i>4 hours</i>- [ ] <i>End of Shift</i>- [ ] <i>Other:</i> ______________________<br><br><b>SECTION E - SIGNATURES</b><br>Requester Signature: ________________________ Date: ___________<br>Supervising Researcher (if required): ___________________________<br><br>LCZ Security Officer Authorizing Release:<br>Name: __________________________ Signature: ______________________<br><br>Object Released By (Vault Officer): ____________________________<br><br><b>FOR SECURITY USE ONLY</b><br><i>Return Inspection Notes:</i> __________________________________________<br><i>Status:</i> [ ]  Cleared for Re-Shelving. [ ] Sent for Decon. [ ] Hold for Review<br><i>Chain-of-Custody Verified By: (If Applicable)</i> _____________________<br><br>";
	name = "22-C Object Checkout Form "
	},
